usage: replay_and_test.py [-h] --source-zip SOURCE_ZIP --return-zip RETURN_ZIP
                          --compare-work COMPARE_WORK --out OUT
                          [--test-timeout TEST_TIMEOUT]

Replay an exact review ZIP, then test its fresh checkout inside private
TMPDIR. Run through run_with_private_tmpfs.py. Retained output must be a new
directory outside TMPDIR. The official replay receipt is copied byte-for-byte
and remains separate from this driver's subsequent test evidence.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source-zip SOURCE_ZIP
  --return-zip RETURN_ZIP
  --compare-work COMPARE_WORK
  --out OUT
  --test-timeout TEST_TIMEOUT
